# In local dev, leave this empty: the Vite dev server proxies /api/* to the
# Rails backend on http://localhost:3000 (same-origin from the browser's POV,
# so no CORS check). See vite.config.ts for the proxy config.
#
# In production (Render Static Site), set this to the backend's public URL,
# e.g. https://smart-reviewer-api.onrender.com — the frontend will then call
# the API cross-origin and rack-cors on the backend will handle it.
VITE_API_URL=
